{"turn_id": "d27-t1", "session_id": "d27", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_source_platform", "text": "无标注文本来自中国的 Sina Weibo 服务（即新浪微博）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "data_follows_peng_dredze", "text": "论文使用的标注语料是对 Peng and Dredze 的语料进行修改所得，且使用与 Peng and Dredze 相同的无标注文本。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d27-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d27-t2", "session_id": "d27", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "labelled_corpus_source", "text": "论文使用的是一个「修改过的标注语料」（a modified labelled corpus），其来源与 Peng 和 Dredze (peng-dredze:2016:P16-2) 一致，用于中文社交媒体 NER。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "data_details_in_table", "text": "该数据的细节列在 Table TABREF19 中。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "unlabelled_text_platform", "text": "论文使用的未标注文本与 Peng 和 Dredze (peng-dredze:2016:P16-2) 相同，来自中国的 Sina Weibo（新浪微博）服务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "segmentation_tool", "text": "这些文本由中文分词系统 Jieba 进行分词，与 Peng 和 Dredze (peng-dredze:2016:P16-2) 的做法一致，以便结果更具可比性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "limited_labelled_corpus", "text": "论文指出中文社交媒体方面存在大量未标注文本但标注语料非常有限（quite limited labelled corpus / scant labelled Chinese social media corpus），这构成了任务的挑战之一。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9a8e2c5a1623ba6a00cddbb9"}, {"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9c109743050dbae8f60937f3"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d27-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d27-t3", "session_id": "d27", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "c1_data_source_paper1", "text": "在《F-Score Driven Max Margin Neural Network for Named Entity Recognition in Chinese Social Media》中，数据来自中国的新浪微博（Sina Weibo）服务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "c2_data_source_paper2", "text": "在《Who's to say what's funny? A computer using Language Models and Deep Learning, That's Who!》中，数据是由推特（tweets）构成，这些幽默推文是为喜剧中心（Comedy Central）电视节目 @midnight with Chris Hardwick 期间提供的 hashtag 提示而提交的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-04fd36e8ebf0badf98e5c22f"}, {"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-42b2a8b4190d48e2271bf4e7"}]}, {"key": "c3_platform_comparability", "text": "两篇论文的数据来源平台不同：前者使用新浪微博（中国社交媒体），后者使用推特（tweet）数据；证据中未说明二者的具体可比程度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}, {"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-04fd36e8ebf0badf98e5c22f"}]}, {"key": "c4_lm_prediction_ngram", "text": "在《Who's to say what's funny?...》中，系统使用传统 N-gram 语言模型估计推文概率，用 bigram 和 trigram 作为特征，并使用带修改的 Kneser-Ney 平滑和回退技术的 KenLM 工具。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-42b2a8b4190d48e2271bf4e7"}]}, {"key": "c5_lm_prediction_corpora", "text": "该论文从两个不同语料库建立语言模型：一个来自 @midnight 节目的搞笑推文集合，另一个是免费供研究使用的新闻数据语料库。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-42b2a8b4190d48e2271bf4e7"}]}, {"key": "c6_lm_prediction_scoring", "text": "推文的评分方式为：根据搞笑推文模型概率更高者被认为更好笑（因为更像幽默训练数据），而根据新闻语言模型概率更低者被认为更好笑（因为最不像不搞笑的新闻语料）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-42b2a8b4190d48e2271bf4e7"}]}, {"key": "c7_lm_ranking", "text": "该论文使用语言模型和深度学习方法，使潜在幽默的陈述可以相对彼此进行排序（ranking），而非仅做二分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-04fd36e8ebf0badf98e5c22f"}, {"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-ab1f50c84fac89c654f4ed96"}]}, {"key": "c8_lm_deeplearning_outline", "text": "该论文报告了使用语言模型方法的结果，并概述了未来使用深度学习方法的计划，而非已用深度学习模型做幽默预测。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-ab1f50c84fac89c654f4ed96"}]}, {"key": "c9_ner_model_paper1", "text": "在《F-Score Driven Max Margin...》中，提出的模型是基于 B-LSTM 神经网络的半监督学习模型，并把 CRF 等传统方法中的转移概率与深度学习结合。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9a8e2c5a1623ba6a00cddbb9"}]}, {"key": "c10_ner_usage_paper1", "text": "该论文的模型用于中文社交媒体命名实体识别（NER），构造了可直接在 F-score 上训练的模型，并提出在 F-score 和标签准确率上联合训练的集成方法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9a8e2c5a1623ba6a00cddbb9"}]}, {"key": "c11_task_comparability", "text": "两篇论文的任务不同：前者是中文社交媒体命名实体识别（NER），后者是幽默陈述的检测与排序；证据中未说明二者使用语言模型/神经网络进行预测的方式具有直接可比性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9a8e2c5a1623ba6a00cddbb9"}, {"paper_id": "1705.10272", "chunk_id": "c-ab1f50c84fac89c654f4ed96"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d27-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
